@startuml
state WaitingState [*]
state ActiveState
state ExpiredState
state ArchivedRemovedState

[*] -> WaitingState:Start Date Arrival
WaitingState --> ActiveState:Current Date Surpasses Start Date
ActiveState --> ActiveState:End of Validity Period
ActiveState --> ExpiredState:Finish Date Reached
ExpiredState --> ArchivedRemovedState:One Year after Expiration Date
@enduml
